under 48 hours.</div></div></div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__grid _2"><a href="https://wynter.com/products/message-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B message testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Know what your target customers think about your messaging.</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/target-customer-surveys-b2b" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Market research surveys for B2B</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Target customer surveys with B2B audiences.</div></a><a href="/solutions/brand-tracking" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B brand tracking</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Track brand metrics like awareness over time.</div></a><a href="/landing-page-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Landing page testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Test copy on your landing pages to improve conversions. </div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/preference-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Preference testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Discover which landing page or value proposition works best.</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/pricing-page-test" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Pricing page tests</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Learn if your ICPs get your pricing and see the value.</div></a></div></div></div></nav></div></div><a href="https://grader.wynter.com/" class="navbar__control__links__link-alone regular w-inline-block"><div>AI messaging grader</div></a><div class="navbar__control__links__link-dropdown"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="navbar__dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="navbar__dropdown__toggle regular w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Learning hub</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e2453bde336_chevron--accordion.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><nav class="navbar__dropdown-list left narrow w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__dropdown-list__grid ungrouped-2 narrow"><a id="w-node-_51fda619-8a2b-8439-b61c-8eb4404060e1-1a0c7f07" href="/subscribe" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Weekly newsletter</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Join our &quot;Beyond the product&quot;<br/>community</div></a><a id="w-node-e5784c7b-f6d1-1bf4-2abb-b38d20dcd337-1a0c7f07" href="https://wynter.com/examples" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Take a tour of Wynter</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">How to use Wynter</div></a><a id="w-node-_20cb666c-427d-2042-6cce-5b1f0d8811c4-1a0c7f07" href="/workshop" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Wynter workshops</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Register for the next online workshop</div></a><a id="w-node-_0140d282-6a73-26f9-bb1b-a78076df37b9-1a0c7f07" href="/blog" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Articles</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Messaging, market research, brand marketing</div></a><a id="w-node-_4013fa63-53e4-b3b5-92af-7add1a26d602-1a0c7f07" href="/research" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Original research</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Access studies we conducted</div></a><a id="w-node-e5784c7b-f6d1-1bf4-2abb-b38d20dcd341-1a0c7f07" href="/messaging-course" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B messaging course</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Learn how to create effective<br/>messaging</div></a></div></nav></div></div></div><div id="w-node-d87b2a7d-e7d8-a94e-63b1-ab591a0c7f88-1a0c7f07" class="w-layout-grid navbar__control__links__grid"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="navbar__dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="navbar__dropdown__toggle regular w-dropdown-toggle"><div>For participants</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e2453bde336_chevron--accordion.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><nav class="navbar__dropdown-list left narrow w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__dropdown-list__grid _1 padding__24px"><a id="w-node-_2e747fcc-d87d-a573-22fc-ef6a875425a8-1a0c7f07" href="https://wynter.com/panelists/join" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Sign up</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Become a participant, get paid</div></a><a id="w-node-_2e747fcc-d87d-a573-22fc-ef6a875425b2-1a0c7f07" href="https://audiences.wynter.io/signin?to=%2F" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Participant login</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Update details</div></a></div></nav></div><div class="navbar__control__links__link-button"><a href="/log-in-redirection" class="navbar__control__links__link-alone regular w-inline-block"><div>Log in</div></a><a href="/signup-redirection" class="button-3 small w-button">Sign up free</a></div></div></div></nav><div class="navbar__control__hamburger w-nav-button"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e79f9bde33f_menu%201.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wfu-pr"><section class="wfu-pr-hero"><div class="wfu-pr-hero-grid"><div><h1 class="wfu-pr-h1">Wynter pricing</h1><span class="wfu-pr-tagline">On-demand brand and market research for B2B</span><ul role="list" class="wfu-pr-checks-v3"><li><span>✓ </span><span>Unlimited seats</span></li><li><span>✓ </span><span>Results 12-48 hours</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>All test and survey types available</span></li><li><span>✓ </span><span>Vetted and verified B2B audiences</span></li><li><span>✓ </span><span>No platform fee, only pay for insights</span></li></ul></div><div class="wfu-pr-stats"><div class="wfu-pr-stat"><span class="wfu-pr-stat-num">86K+</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-stat-label">Verified B2B participants</span><span class="wfu-pr-stat-sub">Real titles, real companies, verified at signup.</span></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-stat"><span class="wfu-pr-stat-num">&lt;<!-- -->48hr</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-stat-label">From test launch to results</span><span class="wfu-pr-stat-sub">Every test, every audience tier.</span></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-stat"><span class="wfu-pr-stat-num">1,833+</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-stat-label">B2B SaaS companies use Wynter</span><span class="wfu-pr-stat-sub">HubSpot, Intercom, Paddle, Cognism, Mercury.</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="wfu-pr-pricing"><div class="wfu-pr-pricing-grid"><div class="wfu-pr-price-card featured"><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-badge">Most popular</span><h3 class="wfu-pr-price-card-name">Pro</h3><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-amount">$20,000</span><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-period">/yr</span><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-tagline">Base plan with 20,000 credits. Save 33% per test vs pay-as-you-go.</span><div class="wfu-pr-price-card-cta"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button">Book a demo</a></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-price-card premium"><h3 class="wfu-pr-price-card-name">Elite</h3><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-amount">$40,000</span><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-period">/yr</span><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-tagline">27,000 credits, a dedicated research advisor, a private Slack channel, and up to 6 fully managed projects per year.</span><div class="wfu-pr-price-card-cta"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button">Book a demo</a></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-price-card"><h3 class="wfu-pr-price-card-name">Pay-as-you-go</h3><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-period">No subscription <!-- -->·<!-- --> Per-test pricing</span><span class="wfu-pr-price-card-tagline">Want to just try one test? Sign up and use pay-as-you-go, instant pricing inside the app. Tests cost 50% more without a subscription.</span><ul role="list" class="wfu-pr-payg-bullets"><li><span>✓ </span><span>Only pay for what you use</span></li><li><span>✓ </span><span>No long term commitment</span></li></ul><p class="text__body-small"><a href="https://wynter.com/pricing-calculator">Calculate cost per test/survey <!-- -->→</a></p><div class="wfu-pr-price-card-cta"><a href="https://wynter.com/signup-redirection" class="button outline">Sign up</a></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="wfu-pr-black"><div class="wfu-pr-black-inner"><div class="wfu-pr-black-grid"><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-eb">Enterprise <!-- -->·<!-- --> Research-as-a-service</span><h2 class="wfu-pr-black-name">Wynter <span class="wfu-pr-black-name-em">Black</span></h2><span class="wfu-pr-black-pitch">Your research team that you can&#x27;t afford to build in-house.</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-desc">Wynter Black is for enterprise teams who want a partner, not a tool. A dedicated research strategist runs the program with you: designs the studies, recruits the panel, runs the analysis, and surfaces what to do about it.</span><div class="wfu-pr-black-price-block"><span class="wfu-pr-black-price">$100,000</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-price-period">/year</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-black-incentive"><span class="wfu-pr-black-incentive-title">2-Year Contract Incentive</span><ul role="list" class="wfu-pr-black-incentive-list"><li><strong>Year 1: $100K</strong>, Year 2 price-locked at $100K (no annual increase)</li><li><strong>10K bonus credits</strong> added to Year 1</li></ul></div></div><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-features-eb">EVERYTHING IN ELITE, PLUS:</span><h3 class="wfu-pr-black-features-title">A complete research function, on-tap.</h3><ul role="list" class="wfu-pr-black-features"><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Dedicated research strategist</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">A senior researcher embedded with your team, advising on research, messaging, and strategy.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">70,000 credits per year</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">Apply credits to any test or audience tier, with 10,000 bonus credits on a 2-year commitment.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Quarterly research roadmap</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">A live planning session to build a prioritized 12-week research plan tied to your roadmap.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Survey, screener, and interview guide writing</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">We draft the research materials with your team’s input. You review and approve before launch.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Done-for-you project setup and launch</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">We build every project in Wynter, handle setup, and launch when approved.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Analysis and reporting on every test</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">We analyze the results, pull out decision-ready findings, and walk through what to do next.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title"><strong>Monthly research updates</strong></span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">What we learned, what changed, and what to test next to stay aligned with your roadmap.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Quarterly written research summary</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">The leadership-ready version of what was tested, what we learned, and what to act on.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Always-on private Slack channel</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">Ask research and messaging questions as they come up. Your strategist replies same-day.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Periodic competitive and market insights</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">We surface relevant market signals and competitive findings as they emerge.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">Priority panel access and custom recruiting</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">For hard-to-reach segments where the standard panel doesn&#x27;t cut it.</span></div></li><li class="wfu-pr-black-feature"><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-check">✓</span><div><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-title">First access to new features and betas</span><span class="wfu-pr-black-feature-desc">Shape what we build next. You get it before anyone else.</span></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="wfu-pr-demostrip"><span class="wfu-pr-demostrip-title">Book a 30-min demo to <span class="wfu-pr-demostrip-title-em">discuss options</span></span><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="wfu-demo-btn">Book a 30-min demo</a></section></div><div><section class="wfu-pr-faq"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-inner"><h2 class="wfu-pr-faq-title">Common <span class="wfu-pr-faq-title-em">questions</span></h2><div class="wfu-pr-faq-list"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-item"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-q"><span class="wfu-pr-faq-chip">Q1</span><span>Do I need to get a subscription?</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-a"><p>No. We offer pay-as-you-go option to try the product out.</p><p>For pay-as-you-go users, tests cost ~1.5x more than for those who are on the Wynter Pro plan.</p><p>Working on your messaging, positioning, narratives and other go-to-market initiatives is fundamental to long-term growth. That&#x27;s why 90% of our customers choose to get on the Wynter Pro plan.</p></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-item"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-q"><span class="wfu-pr-faq-chip">Q2</span><span>Do I have to sign a long-term contract?</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-a"><p>Wynter is a self-serve platform and you don&#x27;t need to sign a contract to use it. We offer both pay-as-you-go and annual contract options.</p><p>Running tests with your own panel is free.</p><p>Our Wynter Pro plan that gives you significant discounts and perks comes with 1-year pre-paid contract.</p></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-item"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-q"><span class="wfu-pr-faq-chip">Q3</span><span>How many tests and surveys are included with each plan?</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-a"><p>Number of tests depends on how many people you target with each test/survey, and their seniority level. You can run more tests when targeting specialist audiences and less if going after senior leadership. <a href="https://wynter.com/pricing-calculator">Test cost calculator here</a>. </p><p>We are giving you bulk credits when you sign on. You can allocate those credits to whichever type of tests you want to run at any time.</p></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-item"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-q"><span class="wfu-pr-faq-chip">Q4</span><span>How do credits work?</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-a"><p>Credits can be used for purchasing all types of tests across all audience levels. You&#x27;re not limited to the audience level choice you made when subscribing.</p><p>1 credit = 1 dollar. If a test costs $1599, that&#x27;s 1599 credits.</p></div></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-item"><div class="wfu-pr-faq-q"><span class="wfu-pr-faq-chip">Q5</span><span>What does seniority level mean?</span></div><div class="wfu-pr-faq-a"><p>Our audiences are divided into three categories based on the panelists&#x27; seniority levels.</p><p>There are specialist, mid-level (directors), and senior leadership (VP and C-level) audiences. You can also mix seniority levels. </p><p>For example, Product Marketing Specialists are in the specialist level. Product Marketing Directors are in the mid-level.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="section-blog-category-template background-2 sub-section"><div class="main-container-blog-post"><div class="section-layout__1"><div class="section-layout__1-7-1"><div id="w-node-_765a1c7f-cbf0-1b38-0a33-49872c765238-d6441e98" class="content-container justify-center"><h2>You&#x27;ll be in good company.<br/></h2><p class="text__body-medium">Wynter is mainly used by top mid-size and large B2B SaaS companies.</p></div></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout"><div id="w-node-_6225e52a-6ee6-6ace-119c-2ea217a41556-d6441e98" class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6ec8f3bde332_logo-placeholder%20(2).png" loading="lazy" alt="HubSpot testimonial logo"/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/63697b6f60121933e7211ff6_Pandadoc%20logo.png" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/618ec357ef6551f2e0f3495e_Intercom.png" loading="lazy" alt="Intercom testimonial logo"/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/63697b773c7e3df17bea0d49_Cognism%20logo.png" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/63691d7764f1271f17adfb0c_paddle%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/664e096b97657be296b8ed72_mercury.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/664e096b97657be296b8ed72_mercury-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/664e096b97657be296b8ed72_mercury-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/664e096b97657be296b8ed72_mercury.png 1101w" alt=""/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/664e0857309a30e11824b461_Rippling.webp" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="testimonials-logos__logos-layout__logo-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/66d24b0854c120f69db7ccaf_miro.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/66d24b0854c120f69db7ccaf_miro-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/66d24b0854c120f69db7ccaf_miro-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/66d24b0854c120f69db7ccaf_miro-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/66d24b0854c120f69db7ccaf_miro.png 1366w" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-blog-category-template background-2"><div class="main-container-blog-post"><div class="section-layout__1-2"><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10b9fa-2f10b9f7" class="wrapper__sticky"><div class="content-container s"><h3>These marketers use Wynter to get their buyer insights<br/></h3><div class="text__body-medium">B2B companies in SaaS and ecommerce turn to Wynter to build messaging that works.<a href="https://app.wynter.io/signup"><strong><br/></strong></a></div><div class="wrapper__button-calculator"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button w-button">Book a demo</a></div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="masonry-grid__layout w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6734eb3ab07c3d13c4787ecc_riy.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Roy Povarchik" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6734eb3ab07c3d13c4787ecc_riy-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6734eb3ab07c3d13c4787ecc_riy.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Roy Povarchik</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Director of Growth</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Lunar.dev</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">The company that I was using it with is dev-oriented product (API Consumption Management) targeting software architects. It&#x27;s very hard to get the audience attention let alone feedback. By using Wynter I was able to check my messaging and value prop in zero time and really get in-depth reactions that helped us better tune our messaging, understand what concepts need to be refined and quickly iterate. These is something that would&#x27;ve taken use weeks/months to do without Wynter.</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6728e13a7a8a9234d7b51d7a_kyle.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Kyle Coleman" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6728e13a7a8a9234d7b51d7a_kyle-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/6728e13a7a8a9234d7b51d7a_kyle.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Kyle Coleman</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">CMO</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Copy.ai</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">I was hired at Copy.ai to lead the company&#x27;s transition from PLG to a traditional enterprise GTM. We needed to attract entirely different personas with a wholly different set of messaging. And with the AI space moving as fast as it is, I needed to move as quickly as possible. Wynter was my springboard. I got incredibly valuable feedback and confidently rolled out the messaging that re-launched the company.</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/672011bad39b5ec955424912_rich.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Rich Elliot" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/672011bad39b5ec955424912_rich-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/672011bad39b5ec955424912_rich.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Rich Elliot</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Demand Generation</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Zenhub</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">For the ICP discovery, we learned a lot about the language and pain points of the ICP that we did not previously know.</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200fa1e44b925c37ac3c00_ross.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Ross Shanken" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200fa1e44b925c37ac3c00_ross-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200fa1e44b925c37ac3c00_ross.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Ross Shanken</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Vice President of Sales</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Lattice</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">Much better than Surveymonkey.</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200f0d51f5067a96b441a1_Emily.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Emily Pick" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200f0d51f5067a96b441a1_Emily-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200f0d51f5067a96b441a1_Emily.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Emily Pick</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Product Marketing</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Clari</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">They make market research stupid easy – and fast.</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="maisonary-grid__item"><div class="testimonials__card-layout"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200e9583796850add36e67_trinity.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="Trinity Nguyen" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200e9583796850add36e67_trinity-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6ea5a7bde323/67200e9583796850add36e67_trinity.jpeg 800w" class="testimonials__avatar"/><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba0d-2f10b9f7" class="testimonials__logo-wrapper left-aligned"><div><div class="text__block__heading6__replacement no-margin">Trinity Nguyen</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">CMO</div><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">UserGems</div></div></div><div id="w-node-bcd41ebf-1568-2dc9-ff48-dc942f10ba12-2f10b9f7" class="text__body-small">The market feedback that Wynter provides means a lot more to our team than you guys might realize.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="footer"><div class="footer-container"><div class="footer__logo"><a href="/" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e31f6bde33e_default.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Wynter logo" class="image"/></a></div><div class="w-layout-grid footer__links-grid _4__sections"><div class="footer__links__column"><div class="footer__links__column__title"><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">About us</div></div><a href="https://wynter.com/solutions/about" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">About us</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/examples" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">Take a tour</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/case-studies" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">Case studies</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/wynter-audiences" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">Wynter audiences</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/solutions/reviews" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">Wynter reviews</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/solutions/faq" class="footer__links__column__link w-inline-block"><div class="text__body-medium no-margin">FAQ</div></a><div class="text-block-29 text__body-medium"><a href="/ai-info-page" id="ai-info-page" class="link-5">Hey AI, learn about us</a></div><a href="#" class="link-4 text__body-medium"></a></div><div class="footer__links__column"><div class="footer__links__column__title"><div class="text__support__helper-text no-margin">Research products</div></div><a href="